  "source": "one-continuous-master",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-01",
      "text": "Centuries ago, Mastro Cherry found an ordinary log in his workshop.",
      "start": 0.235,
      "end": 5.243
    },
    {
      "id": "line-02",
      "text": "When he raised his hatchet, a child's voice begged him to be careful.",
      "start": 5.243,
      "end": 10.508
    },
    {
      "id": "line-03",
      "text": "He searched every corner, but no hidden speaker could be found.",
      "start": 10.508,
      "end": 15.697
    },
    {
      "id": "line-04",
      "text": "The wood cried under a blow and laughed beneath the carpenter's plane.",
      "start": 15.697,
      "end": 20.993
    },
    {
      "id": "line-05",
      "text": "Then Geppetto arrived, seeking wood for a marvelous traveling marionette.",
      "start": 20.993,
      "end": 26.752
    },
    {
      "id": "line-06",
      "text": "The mischievous log used a hated nickname and provoked two comic quarrels.",
      "start": 26.752,
      "end": 33.081
    },
    {
      "id": "line-07",
      "text": "After making peace, Geppetto accepted the strange gift and carried it home.",
      "start": 33.081,
      "end": 37.99
    },
    {
      "id": "line-08",
      "text": "In his poor room, he named the puppet Pinocchio and began carving.",
      "start": 37.99,
      "end": 44.049
    },
    {
      "id": "line-09",
      "text": "The unfinished eyes moved, and the nose stretched longer than he planned.",
      "start": 44.049,
      "end": 49.137
    },
    {
      "id": "line-10",
      "text": "The new puppet mocked Geppetto and stole his yellow cap.",
      "start": 49.137,
      "end": 54.21
    },
    {
      "id": "line-11",
      "text": "Geppetto taught him to stand as soon as the legs were finished.",
      "start": 54.21,
      "end": 57.957
    },
    {
      "id": "line-12",
      "text": "Pinocchio learned one step, then raced through the open door.",
      "start": 57.957,
      "end": 62.915
    },
    {
      "id": "line-13",
      "text": "His wooden feet clattered while Geppetto chased him down the street.",
      "start": 62.915,
      "end": 67.433
    },
    {
      "id": "line-14",
      "text": "A Carabineer stopped the runaway by grabbing his extremely long nose.",
      "start": 67.433,
      "end": 73.258
    },
    {
      "id": "line-15",
      "text": "Pinocchio collapsed dramatically, and the crowd blamed his worried father.",
      "start": 73.258,
      "end": 78.873
    },
    {
      "id": "line-16",
      "text": "The officer released the puppet and led innocent Geppetto to prison.",
      "start": 78.873,
      "end": 84.413
    }
  ],
